+                "{arch} inline asm: memory operand {i} (name {:?}, constraint {:?}) still has \
+                 no address after operand resolution; substituting it would print an empty \
+                 operand and emit a truncated instruction",
+                op.name, op.constraint,
+            );
+        }
+    }
